                <h3>Intervening relationship <span>Mediation model</span></h3>
                <figure class="map-figure"><div class="map-canvas mediation-canvas" aria-label="Three blank observed-variable rectangles form an indirect path, with a direct path from the first to the last rectangle.">
                  <button type="button" class="map-shape map-box role-slot mediation-x" data-answer="independent-x" data-placeholder="" data-empty-label="Blank rectangle at the start of an indirect path" data-explanation="Independent Variable / X begins the mediated pathway."></button>
