                  <span class="canvas-arrow covariance-x-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                  <button type="button" class="map-shape map-box role-slot covariance-y" data-answer="dependent-y" data-placeholder="" data-empty-label="Blank outcome rectangle receiving two arrows" data-explanation="Dependent Variable / Y is the outcome receiving separate paths from X and C."></button>
                </div><figcaption>Two background variables covary and both point to an outcome.</figcaption></figure>
                <p class="map-slot-explanation" data-model-slot-explanation data-default="After checking, click a filled shape to see its role." aria-live="polite">After checking, click a filled shape to see its role.</p>
