                <h3>條件關係 <span>調節模型</span></h3>
                <figure class="map-figure"><div class="map-canvas moderation-canvas" aria-label="上方的空白矩形指向兩個空白矩形之間的箭頭。">
                  <button type="button" class="map-shape map-box role-slot moderator-w" data-answer="moderator-w" data-placeholder="" data-empty-label="指向主要關係的空白矩形" data-explanation="調節變量／W 指向 X → Y 的箭頭：它說明關係在何時或對誰會改變。"></button>
                  <span class="moderator-pointer" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                  <button type="button" class="map-shape map-box role-slot moderation-x" data-answer="independent-x" data-placeholder="" data-empty-label="受調節路徑起點的空白矩形" data-explanation="自變量／X 是關係強度或方向可能改變的起點。"></button>
                  <span class="canvas-arrow moderation-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                  <button type="button" class="map-shape map-box role-slot moderation-y" data-answer="dependent-y" data-placeholder="" data-empty-label="受調節路徑終點的空白矩形" data-explanation="因變量／Y 是受調節關係的結果。"></button>
                </div><figcaption>情境變量指向 X → Y 的箭頭。</figcaption></figure>
                <p class="map-slot-explanation" data-model-slot-explanation data-default="檢查後，點選已填寫的形狀以了解其角色。" aria-live="polite">檢查後，點選已填寫的形狀以了解其角色。</p>
              </article>
              <article class="relationship-canvas-card" data-model-card>
                <h3>背景關聯 <span>共變異數／控制模型</span></h3>
                <figure class="map-figure"><div class="map-canvas covariance-canvas" aria-label="兩個空白矩形共變，並同時指向第三個空白矩形。">
                  <button type="button" class="map-shape map-box role-slot covariance-c" data-answer="control-c" data-placeholder="" data-empty-label="與 X 共變的空白背景矩形" data-explanation="控制變量／C 是在解釋 Y 時與 X 一併納入的背景預測因素。"></button>
                  <button type="button" class="map-shape map-box role-slot covariance-x" data-answer="independent-x" data-placeholder="" data-empty-label="與 C 共變的空白自變量矩形" data-explanation="自變量／X 是 Y 的焦點預測因素，並可能與控制變量共變。"></button>
                  <span class="covariance-arc" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                  <span class="canvas-arrow covariance-c-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                  <span class="canvas-arrow covariance-x-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                  <button type="button" class="map-shape map-box role-slot covariance-y" data-answer="dependent-y" data-placeholder="" data-empty-label="接收兩條箭頭的空白結果矩形" data-explanation="因變量／Y 是同時接收 X 與 C 的獨立路徑的結果。"></button>
                </div><figcaption>兩個背景變量共變，且均指向結果。</figcaption></figure>
                <p class="map-slot-explanation" data-model-slot-explanation data-default="檢查後，點選已填寫的形狀以了解其角色。" aria-live="polite">檢查後，點選已填寫的形狀以了解其角色。</p>
              </article>
              <article class="relationship-canvas-card sem-canvas-card" data-model-card>
                <h3>進階預覽 <span>結構方程模型（SEM）</span></h3>
                <figure class="map-figure"><div class="sem-canvas" aria-label="空白題目矩形測量兩個由方向性路徑連結的空白潛在變量橢圓。">
                  <div class="sem-measurement"><div class="sem-items" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><div class="sem-errors" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><span class="measurement-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span><button type="button" class="map-shape map-oval role-slot" data-answer="latent-variable" data-placeholder="" data-empty-label="由觀察題目測量的空白潛在變量橢圓" data-explanation="潛在變量是不可直接觀察的構念，以橢圓表示，並由多個觀察題目矩形測量。"></button></div>
                  <span class="canvas-arrow sem-structural-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                  <div class="sem-measurement"><div class="sem-items" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><div class="sem-errors" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><span class="measurement-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span><button type="button" class="map-shape map-oval role-slot" data-answer="latent-variable" data-placeholder="" data-empty-label="由另一個潛在變量預測的空白潛在變量橢圓" data-explanation="潛在變量是不可直接觀察的構念，以橢圓表示，並由多個觀察題目矩形測量。"></button></div>
                </div><figcaption>題目矩形測量潛在橢圓；橢圓由結構路徑連結。</figcaption></figure>
                <p class="map-slot-explanation" data-model-slot-explanation data-default="檢查後，點選已填寫的形狀以了解其角色。" aria-live="polite">檢查後，點選已填寫的形狀以了解其角色。</p>
              </article>
            </div>
            <div class="variable-match-actions"><button type="button" data-variable-match-check>檢查答案</button><button type="button" data-variable-match-clear>清除</button><span role="status" aria-live="polite" data-variable-match-status></span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="slide literature-activity-slide" data-title="Activity · Build literature-search keywords" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="slide-inner">
        <header class="slide-header"><span class="eyebrow">Activity</span><button class="translate-button" type="button" aria-pressed="false">中文</button></header>
        <div class="language-panel" data-language="en">
          <h2>Build literature-search keywords</h2>
          <p class="lead small-lead">A literature search locates relevant sources; a literature review evaluates, connects and synthesises the sources you select. Start your search terms with the topic, research question or hypothesis, and variables.</p>
          <div class="literature-keyword-activity">
            <div class="keyword-source-cards">
              <article><span class="operationalization-label">Topic</span><p>AI literacy in digital education</p></article>
              <article><span class="operationalization-label">Research question / hypothesis</span><p>Structured AI-literacy instruction → guided AI practice → AI-literacy score</p></article>
              <article><span class="operationalization-label">Variables</span><p>Prior AI experience; access to devices; first-year undergraduates</p></article>
            </div>
            <div class="keyword-practice">
              <p class="activity-prompt"><strong>Your turn:</strong> identify keywords from each source, add synonyms or variants, and then combine only the facets that fit your search purpose. Once complete, use the same three fields as a short transfer check for a topic you may study later.</p>
              <label><span>Topic terms</span><textarea data-save="literature-topic-en" placeholder="e.g., AI literacy; artificial intelligence literacy; AI competencies"></textarea></label>
              <label><span>Question / hypothesis terms</span><textarea data-save="literature-question-en" placeholder="e.g., structured instruction; AI literacy module; guided AI practice"></textarea></label>
              <label><span>Variable / population terms</span><textarea data-save="literature-variable-en" placeholder="e.g., AI-literacy score; undergraduate; prior AI experience"></textarea></label>
              <details class="keyword-reference"><summary>Reveal a reference keyword set</summary><p><strong>Topic:</strong> “AI literacy” OR “artificial intelligence literacy” OR “AI competencies”<br /><strong>Question / hypothesis:</strong> “AI literacy education” OR “AI literacy instruction” OR “guided AI practice”<br /><strong>Variables / population:</strong> “AI literacy scale” OR “AI literacy score” AND undergraduate* OR “higher education”<br /><strong>Starting query:</strong> <code>("AI literacy" OR "artificial intelligence literacy") AND (instruction OR module OR training) AND (undergraduate* OR "higher education")</code></p></details>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="language-panel" data-language="zh" hidden lang="zh-Hant">
          <h2>建立文獻檢索關鍵詞</h2>
          <p class="lead small-lead">文獻檢索用來找出相關來源；文獻綜述則評估、連結和綜合你選取的來源。先從主題、研究問題或假設，以及變量建立檢索詞。</p>
          <div class="literature-keyword-activity">
            <div class="keyword-source-cards">
              <article><span class="operationalization-label">主題</span><p>數字教育中的人工智能素養</p></article>
              <article><span class="operationalization-label">研究問題／假設</span><p>結構化人工智能素養教學 → 引導式人工智能實作 → 人工智能素養分數</p></article>
              <article><span class="operationalization-label">變量</span><p>先前人工智能經驗；裝置使用機會；一年級本科生</p></article>
            </div>
            <div class="keyword-practice">
              <p class="activity-prompt"><strong>輪到你：</strong>從每個來源找出關鍵詞，加入同義詞或變體，然後只合併適合你的檢索目的的面向。完成後，可用同樣三個欄位為你日後可能研究的主題作一個簡短遷移檢查。</p>
              <label><span>主題詞</span><textarea data-save="literature-topic-zh" placeholder="例如：人工智能素養；AI 素養；人工智能能力"></textarea></label>
              <label><span>問題／假設詞</span><textarea data-save="literature-question-zh" placeholder="例如：結構化教學；人工智能素養單元；引導式人工智能實作"></textarea></label>
              <label><span>變量／研究對象詞</span><textarea data-save="literature-variable-zh" placeholder="例如：人工智能素養分數；本科生；先前人工智能經驗"></textarea></label>
              <details class="keyword-reference"><summary>揭示參考關鍵詞組</summary><p><strong>主題：</strong>“AI literacy” OR “artificial intelligence literacy” OR “AI competencies”<br /><strong>問題／假設：</strong>“AI literacy education” OR “AI literacy instruction” OR “guided AI practice”<br /><strong>變量／研究對象：</strong>“AI literacy scale” OR “AI literacy score” AND undergraduate* OR “higher education”<br /><strong>起步檢索式：</strong><code>("AI literacy" OR "artificial intelligence literacy") AND (instruction OR module OR training) AND (undergraduate* OR "higher education")</code></p></details>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

